(218, NULL, NULL, '019713', 'Ms.', 'นางสาว', 'ปาริฉัตร  แก้วปินตา', 'PARICHAT  KAEWPINTA', '1000', NULL, 'Cookware', '1200', NULL, 'CE-Production', '12PO', NULL, 'Production Office', '304', '304', '303', 'Engineer', 'Engineer', '1. Job Header\n1.1 Position Senior Engineering\n1.2 Position Description\n1.3 Company\n1.4 Level   \n1.5 Division Cookware\n1.6 Department 12PO\n1.7 Section  CE-Production Engineering \n1.8 Position Backup  Production Engineer (PE)\n1.9 Position report to this role Production Manager\n1.10 Position Report to   Production Manager\n1.11 Higher Line of Order  Managing Director\n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\n-Manage production planning and material control to achieve on-time delivery.													\n-Adjust manpower, machine capacity, and tooling 													\n-availability to meet existing and future demand.													\n-Shopfloor control and Coordinate with other divisions 													\n-Improve manpower utilization throughout each section in CE.													\n-Provide estimated and actual production data (process flows, cycle times, etc.) to Costing.													\n-Solve material availability issues with PPMC.													\n-Sets WI and complies with the company\'s quality management systems. (ISO9001:2015)													\n-Identify training and development needs for the division.													\n-Other Responsibilities (Perform other duties as assigned by MD/GM)													\n-Implement and drive continuous improvement	activities throughout the plant.													\n-Evaluate manufacturing processes to identify potential	improvements.													\n-Optimize product flows to reduce waste.													\n-support the company’s environmental and safety management	systems. (ISO14001)													\n-Set up processes and systems to create a foundation for long-term improvement.													\n-Control overhead costs and ensure that efficiency objectives are met.													\n-Work with Maintenance to ensure that preventative maintenance (PM) is performed properly.													\n-Ensure that machinery is operated according to work instructions (WI).													\n-Create and drive quality improvement projects 													\n-Create and drive quality improvement projects 													\n-Reduce rework and scrap rates.													\n-Evaluate and find the best solution for all quality issues.													\n-Review customer complaints and take appropriate corrective and preventative action(s).													\n-Ensure that products are manufactured according to product specs.													\n-Safety/Environment, control or ensure safe working conditions and suitable work environment for all employees.																																				\n-Implement and drive the quality continuous improvement activities throughout the plant.													\n-review and support the Internal quality management systems													\n-Yield and WIP control on each section.	\n\n3. Job Competencies\n3.1 Knowledge   Bachelor\'s degree or higher\n3.2 Skills  Computer /Excel\n3.3 Personality Traits', 'รับผิดชอบงานที่ได้รับมอบหมายได้อย่างดีเยี่ยม\nงานที่ได้รับมอบหมายมีประสิทธิภาพที่ดีมาก\nรับผิดชอบงานอื่นๆ ในไลน์การผลิต ทั้งด้านคุณภาพ ความปลอดภัยและ สิ่งแวดล้อม\n\nExcellent responsibility for assigned tasks\nThe assigned work was very effective.\nResponsible for other tasks in the production line Both in terms of quality Safety and Environment\nThe assigned work went smoothly.\nAccepts workloads outside of responsibilities well.\nThe work produced is of excellent quality.', 'L700', 'Below Section Head (TH)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2020-07-01 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:50:46', NULL),
