(734, NULL, NULL, '015398', 'Ms.', 'นางสาว', 'สุพิชญา  แสงอรุณ', 'SUPITCHAYA  SANG-ARUN', '7000', NULL, 'Stainless Steel', '7200', NULL, 'SS-Production', '72WH', NULL, 'Warehouse', '609', '609', '406', 'Operator', 'Operator', '1. Job Header\n1.1 Position - Officer\n1.2 Position Description - WHSS\n1.3 Company - MIL\n1.4 Level - L700\n1.5 Division - 7000\n1.6 Department - 7200\n1.7 Section - 72WH\n1.8 Position Backup - None\n1.9 Position report to this role - None\n1.10 Position Report to WH section head\n1.11 Higher Line of Order - Production Manager\n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\n2.1 Take care of FG and shipment management: Work with Packing, SCM, and Shipping to complete FG loading and release the containers on time\n2.2 Support the raw material store: Receive the raw materials, then update the inventory in the EPICOR system, update the WH layout, and monthly report the cycle count activity \n2.3 Take care of other activities for 72WH such as 6S, CPAR, Meyer TDP, ISO9001\n\n3. Job Competencies\n3.1 Knowledge - Inventory control, Logistics management, PDR, EPICOR, Meyer Sub System, Meyer TDP\n3.2 Skills - Computer Skill, Collaboration Skill, Communication Skill\n3.3 Personality Traits - Attention to detail, Quick response, Data Accuracy', 'She is an operator in the SS warehouse who replaces the former WH officer. She can still take care of shipment arrangements, cycle count, data entry, and inventory control, and she is able to deal with SCM and Shipping departments. Moreover, she is a Warehouse representative and a member of the 6S committee at SS Div.', 'L800', 'Daily Worker ', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2012-07-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:54:17', NULL),
