(1204, NULL, NULL, '019824', 'Mr.', 'นาย', 'ธนภัทร์  แทนสระ', 'TANAPAT  TANSARA', 'G000', NULL, 'General Office', 'G900', NULL, 'Process Improvement', 'G9PI', NULL, 'Process Improvement', '403', '403', '402', 'Programmer', 'Programmer', '1. Job Header\n1.1 Position - Senior Programmer\n1.2 Position Description - Senior Programmer\n1.3 Company - MIL \n1.4 Level - L700\n1.5 Division - G000\n1.6 Department - G900\n1.7 Section - G9PI\n1.8 Position Backup - Supervisor\n1.9 Position report to this role - Programmer\n1.10 Position Report to - Supervisor\n1.11 Higher Line of Order - Programmer < Senior Programmer < Supervisor < Manager \n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\n2.1 Write programs that require a high level of programming tools, or a program that has high complex, or a\nprogram that has height processing conditions, or a program that has a large amount of data.\n2.2 Write programs and design programs that are unclear about the work process.\n2.3 Write programs that are important in terms of data security, Or write a program where the information is\nquite secret, Or write programs related to personal data.\n2.4  Supervise various program projects in the G9PI department to ensure they work normally.\n2.5  Advise, solve problems, make decisions using the best option based on on reason, experience,\nenvironmental suitability, and various factors involved at the time.\n2.6 Discuss, meet, summarize work options, and plan for collaborative work with other departments as\nappropriate.\n2.7  Provide recommendations, develop, improve the efficiency of programs in the G9PI department to have good work performance, easy to use, and continuously improve programs to respond to current technology\ntrends.\n\n\n3. Job Competencies \n3.1 Knowledge - Understanding the Big Picture ; Good Mentor Mind\n3.2 Skills - Great Communication Skills ;  ; OOP ; C++ ;  Java ; SQL Server  ;  HTML : ASP.Net ; VB.Net \n3.3 Personality Traits -  Investigative  ; Openness ; Continuously Learning', 'Tanapat worked 1 year before joined MIL, thus his total working experience is 3-4 years. \n\nTanapat develops the following platforms :\nSafety-IFR = Injury Frequency Rate \nP7EV-GHG = MIL Sustainability \nTooling TMS = Tooling Management System \n\nTanapat is maintaining the following platforms :\nTDP = Training & Development Program \nCTD = Coating Testing Database\nTooling TMS = Tooling Management System\nMIL Energy = Natural Gas and Electricity Usage and Cost Allocation \n\nTanapat is underpaid.  \n\nG9PI just employ a new programmer, with about 3 years experience and this new staff\'s salary is 28,000 Baht.', 'L700', 'Below Section Head (TH)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021-10-05 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:57:16', NULL),
