(1370, NULL, NULL, '019582', 'Mr.', 'นาย', 'มนชัย  แสนสามารถ', 'MONCHAI  SAENSAMART', 'P000', NULL, 'General Production', 'P500', NULL, 'Production Engineering', 'P5TL', NULL, 'Tooling', '304', '304', '303', 'Engineer', 'Engineer', '1. Job Header\n1.1 Position: Senior Engineer\n1.2 Position Description: Tooling Engineer\n1.3 Company: Meyer Industries\n1.4 Level\n1.5 Division: P500\n1.6 Department: Tooling Department\n1.7 Section: P5TL\n1.8 Position Backup: Tooling Engineer\n1.9 Position report to this role: Tooling Manager\n1.10 Position Report to: Tooling Manager\n1.11 Higher Line of Order: Tooling Manager\n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\nRespond to Tooling job, planning, release process flow, plan for raw material, work with production and who are concerned inside and outside to achieve Tooling KPI target.  \n3. Job Competencies\n3.1 Knowledge: Tooling and mold maintenance\n3.2 Skills: He can make decisions for the plan Tooling job.\n3.3 Personality Traits: work with concerned people.', 'He worked with the Tooling Team for more than 6 years. He can help with planning jobs, releasing process flow for tooling parts, planning for raw materials such as providing and releasing orders, and working with production and those concerned inside and outside to achieve the tooling KPI target.  \nHe is Int. Auditor for ISO9001, ISO 14001 & ISO 45001', 'L700', 'Below Section Head (TH)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2018-03-05 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:58:18', NULL),
