(1392, NULL, NULL, '009931', 'Mr.', 'นาย', 'คณิตภูมิ  ดุลยเกษม', 'KANITPOOM  DULYAKASAME', 'P000', NULL, 'General Production', 'P700', NULL, 'Environment', 'P7EV', NULL, 'Environment', '302', '302', '301', 'Asst Supervisor', 'Asst Supervisor', '1. Job Header \n1.1 Position :  Asst. Supervisor\n1.2 Position Description :  Asst. Supervisor\n1.3 Company : Meyer Industries Limited\n1.4 Level : -\n1.5 Division : General\n1.6 Department : P7EV\n1.7 Section : P7EV\n1.8 Position Backup : Supervisor\n1.9 Position report to this role :  Asst. Supervisor\n1.10 Position Report to :  Asst. Manager\n1.11 Higher Line of Order : Asst. Manager\n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\n     2.1  ISO 14001 - CB, MS, PVD and Overview\n            2.1.1  Advise production to prepare the environmental aspect.\n            2.1.2  Prepare and revise the work instruction and procedure\n            2.1.3  Prepare environmental impact assessment from incident\n            2.1.4  Prepare and follow up environment management program\n            2.1.5  EMS Internal Audit\n            2.1.6  Provide environmental training to employees and advise about environment.\n            2.1.7  Analyze impact of environment.\n            2.1.8  Propose about environment improvement to management\n            2.1.9  Environmental patrol\n            2.1.10  Advise, review and follow up CPAR\n            2.1.11  Support the information for the Management Review Meeting\n            2.1.12  Support the information for the upgrade and transition certification\n            2.1.13  Support information to environmental manager\n\n     2.2  ISO 45001 - CB, MS, PVD and Overview\n             2.2.1  Advise about prepare HI & RA to production\n             2.2.2  Control for HZ Material storage\n             2.2.3  SMS & PSM Internal Audit\n             2.2.4  Propose about safety improvement to management\n             2.2.5  Instructor for ISO 45001 System\n             2.2.6  Advise, review and follow up CPAR\n             2.2.7  Conclude the information for the Management Review Meeting\n             2.2.8  Support the process for upgrade and transition certification\n             2.2.9  Support information to the environmental manager\n\n     2.3  ISO 9001 - CB, MS, PVD and overview\n             2.3.1  QMS Internal Audit\n             2.3.2  Instructor for QMS\n             2.3.3  Follow up and review to close the internal CPAR and External CPAR\n\n      2.4  Energy management System\n             2.4.1  Improve Energy used\n             2.4.2  Establish yearly energy management report as legal request.\n             2.4.3  Propose about energy improvement to management\n             2.4.4  Advise production to prepare the energy saving program\n             2.4.5  Prepare the MIL energy report\n\n      2.5  ISO 14064-1\n             2.5.1  Prepare WI and procedure\n             2.5.2  Leader team to implement ISO 14061-1 till achieve the certificate\n             2.5.3  Collect data for calculate GHG emission\n             2.5.4  Analyze data to reduce GHG quantity.\n             2.5.5  Prepare the MIL GHG inventory report\n\n      2.6  Water Pollution Controller\n      2.7  Industrial Waste Controller\n      2.8  Air Pollution Controller\n      2.9  6S - CB, MS and PVD\n      2.10  Report to customer\n      2.11  Report for legal requirement\n                Solvent, types and quantities of pollutants discharged from the factory and monthly report \n                receiving and disbursement.     \n\n3. Job Competencies\n3.1 Knowledge\n       ISO 14001, 45001, 9001, 14061-1, 50001 and Energy Conservation, Pollution Controller, environmental and Safety legal and HZ specialist.\n\n3.2 Skills\n      MS offices, communication skill, Auditing, Leadership, Mediation and consult.\n\n3.3 Personality Traits\n      Energetic, Good attitude, Team player and Team Leader, Empower Team, good relationship, good interpersonal relationship, and adaptable and flexible.', 'In the past till last year, he has full responsible for implement the GHG or ISO 14064-1 and gain the certify.\nHe is the good leadership, initiative innovation, good job attitude, good time management.  he able to lead their team to successful for the responsible job.', 'L700', 'Below Section Head (TH)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2009-07-17 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:58:27', NULL),
