(1453, NULL, NULL, '020010', 'Mr.', 'นาย', 'สราวุฒิ    แก้วบุดดา', 'SARAWUT  KAEWBUDDA', 'P000', NULL, 'General Production', 'PDDD', NULL, 'R&D', 'PDRD', NULL, 'R&D', '303', '303', '301', 'Senior Engineer', 'Senior Engineer', '1. Job Header\n1.1 Position\n1.2 Position Description\n1.3 Company\n1.4 Level\n1.5 Division\n1.6 Department\n1.7 Section\n1.8 Position Backup\n1.9 Position report to this role\n1.10 Position Report to\n1.11 Higher Line of Order\n\n2. Role and Responsibilities (Key Responsibility / Task)\n\n3. Job Competencies\n3.1 Knowledge\n3.2 Skills\n3.3 Personality Traits', 'Throughout the year, our R&D department faced several challenges, including the departure of Wat, our former R&D Manager, and the return of Sarawut as a Senior Engineer. After evaluating the team\'s performance, I believe it\'s time to recognize Sarawut\'s exceptional leadership and contribution to the team.\n\nSarawut has demonstrated outstanding leadership skills by effectively managing multiple projects and fostering collaboration across departments, such as production, laboratory, and costing teams. Given his familiarity with our processes, products, and his experience with Japanese companies, I propose promoting Sarawut to a leadership role within the department. This promotion would come with a 10% salary increase to reflect his increased responsibilities and contributions.', 'L700', 'Below Section Head (TH)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-05-29 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Passed', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-03-01 07:58:53', NULL),
